{"ref":"BDB, בֶּ֫גֶד²","hw":"בֶּ֫גֶד²","html":"II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּ֫גֶד</span></big>  <strong>n.m. (</strong>except <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 6:20\" href=\"/Leviticus.6.20\">Lv 6:20</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">עָלֶיהָ</span>, but Sam. <span dir=\"rtl\">עליו</span>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.14\">Ez 42:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:27\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.27\">Pr 6:27</a>, cf. Kö<sup>i, 482</sup><strong>) garment, covering</strong>—<a data-ref=\"Genesis 28:2\" href=\"/Genesis.28.2\">Gn 28:2</a> + 36 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּגְדוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 9:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.9.3\">Ez 9:3</a> + (14 times without <em>dag. lene</em> Ges<sup>Lbg 94</sup>); pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּגָדִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 6:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.6.4\">Lv 6:4</a> + 32 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּגְדֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:15\" href=\"/Genesis.27.15\">Gn 27:15</a> + 39 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּגָדֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:20\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.20\">1 K 22:20</a> + 81 times <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּגְדֹתֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:9\" href=\"/Psalms.45.9\">ψ 45:9</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>garment, clothing, raiment, robe</em> of any kind, from the filthy clothing of the leper to the holy robes of the high priest, the simplest covering of the poor as well as the costly raiment of the rich and noble, used throughout Heb. Lit.: <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:53\" href=\"/Genesis.24.53\">Gn 24:53</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 28:20\" href=\"/Genesis.28.20\">28:20</a> (E; 14 times JE), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:2\" href=\"/Exodus.28.2\">Ex 28:2</a> + (P 90 times), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.17\">Dt 24:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:26\" href=\"/Judges.8.26\">Ju 8:26</a> + 4 times <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 19:13\" href=\"/I_Samuel.19.13\">1 S 19:13</a> + 10 times, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:1\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.1\">1 K 1:1</a> + 23 times, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 18:9\" href=\